  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>과학실에 있는 여러가지들을 모아서 원자모형 만들어 보았습니다~ </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>아이들에게 빈공간을 뭘로 설명할까 고민하다 </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>지구과학시간에 쓰던 투명반구가 보이길래 후딱 만들어 보여줬는데 나쁘지 않네요.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/23280C4D58DA1F8F09\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170328_172723210.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"400\"  id=\"A_23280C4D58DA1F8F0942D2\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2271CF4D58DA1F903D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170328_172724785.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"400\"  id=\"A_2271CF4D58DA1F903D4853\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2422B24D58DA1F902D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170328_172725528.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"400\"  id=\"A_2422B24D58DA1F902DDDE7\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2608204D58DA1F9118\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170328_172726245.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_2608204D58DA1F9118BAEC\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2540A14D58DA1F9112\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20170328_172726933.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_2540A14D58DA1F9112F9DF\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
